WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
Do adding and subtracting have an order?

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.320
They are equal partners.

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.420
Work left to right.

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:17.170
10 − 4 + 2 is 6 + 2, which is 8, not 4.

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:21.013
The same goes for multiplying and dividing.
